/** \page epmRequirements Requirements
 *
 * There are a few requirements to get the code running:
 *
 *    - C++ compiler: GCC, Intel or Pathscale (other compilers seem to have problems with Eigen's templates)
 *
 *    - MPI 2
 *
 *    - HDF5 parallel
 *
 *    - Eigen: Is provided as part of the the code tree
 *
 *    - RapidXML: Is provided as part of the code tree
 *
 *    - LAPACK
 *
 *    - FFTW
 *
 *    - Boost: shared_ptr (unless TR1 or C++x0 is available), StaticAssert
*/
